  "limitations": [
    "One one-share passive buy around one same-price best-bid U; inclusive horizon fixed at that source time.",
    "Insertion and ahead-set updates are declared shadow conventions, not venue priority, order-entry eligibility or empirical fill calibration.",
    "Our marker never changes external historical inventories. No trades occur in this interval; accounts and fills remain zero.",
    "The pure module authenticates neither raw data nor session status; the fixed boundary reuses accepted source/status/closure evidence.",
    "No historical raw file is opened or statted. Full raw identity and earlier prefix verification remain inherited prerequisites.",
    "The existing ledger validator executes per admitted call; no new C++/vendor book reconstruction or independent complete historical state is produced.",
    "Purity tripwires are reviewed checks, not an operating-system security sandbox.",
    "Four altered actual outputs exercise specific failure paths; they do not prove arbitrary strategies, future implementations or untested configurations correct.",
    "The new source is uncommitted but hash-bound at execution; old59 files match HEAD. Publication commits identical verified bytes afterwards.",
    "Private harnesses/frozen inputs are required for historical commands; existing outputs refuse and later contexts need reviewed pins."
  ],
